{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "106be4f3ef19c53a3a9ddaa7fc0fc87763b888d6f1480617021656241808b21c", "ja": "（今日は可奈と、PVの撮影に来ている。\n撮影は、順調に進んで……）", "zh": "（今天陪可奈来拍摄PV。\n拍摄进行得很顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "4bec188b856e7a8623fd3bd81bbea29159630e333acb6bcec76773cf55c149e5", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！\n聞いてくださいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生──！\n请听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b26113a8e55504c56b385fa2897412aa04af33db8cb5fc091e9e28b6067399a5", "ja": "どうした、可奈。\n何か問題でもあったのか？", "zh": "怎么了，可奈？\n有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "846d368f3a0d947662701b99f2abfa7179952c958c2e415e4c12bdc25ba0639c", "ja": "はいっ！　私、PV撮影がうれしくて、\n今日はすっごく気合いが入ってるんです！", "zh": "是的！我很高兴能来拍摄PV，\n所以今天非常有干劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b0dc5d338a414723f8cd8606faf556e97e3af59df2dd398c396da399be35eca0", "ja": "そうか。\nでもそれは、いい事なんじゃないのか……？", "zh": "这样啊。\n不过这样不是很好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "1f2f780bdd257618e1064bac8b4a11dc3bc7d3af5a8c055c5bc32fca1d881811", "ja": "いいえ、ダメなんです！　私、いつもとちょっと\n違う雰囲気で歌いたいな～と思って……。", "zh": "不，就因为这样才不行！\n我本来想用跟平时不太一样的感觉来唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "8d2ce4295bdbdc3f31118cd17f9b6d7c03f3809431ab34060cfefe2ba79c3b18", "ja": "最初のうちは、マジメな顔で歌ってたんです。\nでも、だんだんワクワクしてきて……。", "zh": "所以一开始我摆出了很认真的表情。\n可是，后来我越唱越兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "a53174fb346c632e48af478f13187013884b6f5a5891611e115a4a8a77d5fa0f", "ja": "気がついたら、ニコニコで歌っちゃってたんですよ～！\n{$P$}さん、どうしましょう！？", "zh": "一回过神来，我发现自己居然唱得笑咪咪的～！\n{$P$}先生，我该怎么办！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "47dd14aa088bbd9dfc9365452f393785e7bd105ad37adf8c806aa1b1b7fb4782", "ja": "なるほど。\nで、監督に注意されたとか……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以就被导演纠正了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "b7974a232abfec1fa412f042ae907a912ad43ad5806453706d646149dc3edff1", "ja": "いえっ！\n監督さん、「OKでーす！」って。", "zh": "没有啊！\n导演说「OK──！」喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1c464885b914adfcfcca7992204be0f780205bf12e77559e75cffbfeb2e8513c", "ja": "そうか、よかったじゃないか！\n可奈の頑張りのおかげで、いいPVになりそうだな。", "zh": "这样啊，那不是很好吗！\n可奈这么努力，应该能拍出很棒的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "4215fb2133148b687f76119b4677367a44aa270583f1464993e2fbcbd3ea4bea", "ja": "えへっ、そうなんですよ～！\nでもちょっとだけ、さみしい気持ちだったり……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，就是说啊～！\n不过我还是会觉得有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "9ca9cc54ee22275b855fa7b4dfa82ad55e0002b9181f78990c85dc7b0f60093e", "ja": "PV～♪　ぶいぶい、Vサイ～ン♪\nもっともっと～、歌いたかったな～♪", "zh": "PV～♪V、V，V手势～♪\n我还想要～多唱一点～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1142add60e6b9998012855c1c21242f22bd4846c80f1b36c0ed067575d213a89", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n仕事をそんなに楽しめたなら、何よりだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是这样吗？\n看到你这么乐在工作中，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3fc37d1bc0b13b466dbf50a56ded6acba5b3bde312e54b909acfb38023e0478", "ja": "ホントに、すっごく楽しかったんですよ～！\nまだ終わって欲しくないなーって……。", "zh": "今天真的非常开心喔～！\n真希望别这么快结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "2a74961373949664583cf7d42df2ea167f34b606685850cc5b885aa23339b514", "ja": "はっ！？　も、もしかして、\nいつもみたいにNGを出せば、長くできる……？", "zh": "啊！？如、如果说，\n要是我像平常一样NG百出，该不会就能唱久一点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "60146d06fbc9e3012c17e1ce710a2fe5d20f04d8bc23e254e9d31655512ac5a6", "ja": "だ、ダメーッ！\nこんなの、悪い子の考え方だもん！　ダメダメッ！", "zh": "不、不行──！\n坏孩子才会这么想！不行不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5aea668dd7317c50dc009ebcb15b73645345eeb810f1906b82d6cb4612ca9dcd", "ja": "そんなに思い詰めなくても……それに\n歌の仕事なら、これからもたくさんできるから。", "zh": "你也不必这么钻牛角尖吧……\n而且，以后还会有很多演唱的工作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "9b6f27149a1523a91eece1e2614bc97b1efe5c6e9aef7b3e55ad33493ad91674", "ja": "ホントですか！？　わーいやったー♪\n可奈は歌が好き～、雪山でするのはスキ～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？耶～太好了──♪\n可奈爱唱歌～雪山滑雪乐～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "68c3e052e106f2f0ce90390a233753777bad77ebfe4aacdedde217c58951acca", "ja": "はいはい……ほら、早く着替えてこい。\n汗で冷えたらいけないからな。", "zh": "知道了知道了……好啦，赶快去换衣服。\n看你流了这么多汗，要是着凉就不好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "e120df04e65350b09b8d1b062180b0a66470e7e9117e356104e3468a8488c4d5", "ja": "はーいっ！\n……あっ、そうだ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "好的～！\n……啊，对了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "4768ea73aed87da895f665ca5aa0af226f84c4cad4d1e880628a1520b9f5a55b", "ja": "楽しくて、うれしくて、ワクワクしちゃう\n最高のプレゼントありがとうございました！　えへっ♪", "zh": "谢谢你这份令人开心又兴奋的超棒礼物！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0104_1022_p", "source_sha256": "89cd8d3778f85af94b12991b3fd53c89401a4b27fc1a6e26f00e0ae7a1b7ff13", "ja": "（そうか……可奈にとって、仕事は贈り物なんだな。\nこれからも、ずっとそう思ってもらえるといいな）", "zh": "（原来如此……对可奈来说，工作就像礼物一样。\n希望她愿意一直保持这样的心态。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
